    "detailed_description": "<h1>OFFICIAL SITES</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/c19b6a9084e3e72b6f1de807c183b258.webp?t=1752566499\" width=620 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/e13be5bda2cc17df89b32897cd4507b7.webp?t=1752566499\" width=620 height=50 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<i>\u00a0 \u00a0 CHECK THE LINK ON THE RIGHT SIDE</i></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300eKing's Raid\u300f is a real-time strategy RPG where victory comes down to skillful control and smart combinations of your heroes\u2019 abilities. Dive into a richly crafted world full of memorable characters, thrilling combat, and countless adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Real-Time Combat with Tactical Skill Combos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the flow of battle in real time and use your heroes\u2019 unique skills strategically to outplay your enemies. Every fight offers a new challenge and a rush of excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/6eb4d5209ae58eb96edf46610d893e5e.poster.webp?t=1752566499\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/6eb4d5209ae58eb96edf46610d893e5e.webp?t=1752566499\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=360 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect the Heroes You Want \u2013 No Random Gacha</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of random pulls? In \u300eKing's Raid\u300f, you get to choose the heroes you want. Build your perfect team with characters that match your playstyle. Each hero brings unique skills and roles, making team synergy and positioning key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/a28a3d169caceecbfd6a5f53ac1975d1.poster.avif?t=1752566499\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/a28a3d169caceecbfd6a5f53ac1975d1.webm?t=1752566499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/a28a3d169caceecbfd6a5f53ac1975d1.mp4?t=1752566499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Favorites with Stylish Costumes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your favorite heroes stand out! Unlock and equip a wide variety of costumes to express your style and bring even more personality to your squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/9b0c499cc9463465114e6ca356b387ed.poster.avif?t=1752566499\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/9b0c499cc9463465114e6ca356b387ed.webm?t=1752566499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/9b0c499cc9463465114e6ca356b387ed.mp4?t=1752566499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rediscover the Beloved Story of King's Raid</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump back into the world that fans around the world fell in love with. Explore a deep narrative filled with unforgettable characters and epic quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/0fe4fa4df7353be1511f1bd41d97d361.poster.avif?t=1752566499\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/0fe4fa4df7353be1511f1bd41d97d361.webm?t=1752566499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/0fe4fa4df7353be1511f1bd41d97d361.mp4?t=1752566499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Up in Powerful Co-op Raids</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take down massive bosses with your friends in exciting co-op raid battles. Earn powerful gear and keep pushing your limits as the raid bosses grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add the game to your Steam Wishlist and stay up to date by subscribing to our email newsletter or joining us on Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Screenshots shown in the store may differ from actual in-game content.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300eKing's Raid\u300f is a real-time strategy RPG where victory comes down to skillful control and smart combinations of your heroes\u2019 abilities. Dive into a richly crafted world full of memorable characters, thrilling combat, and countless adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Real-Time Combat with Tactical Skill Combos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the flow of battle in real time and use your heroes\u2019 unique skills strategically to outplay your enemies. Every fight offers a new challenge and a rush of excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/6eb4d5209ae58eb96edf46610d893e5e.poster.webp?t=1752566499\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/6eb4d5209ae58eb96edf46610d893e5e.webp?t=1752566499\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=360 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect the Heroes You Want \u2013 No Random Gacha</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of random pulls? In \u300eKing's Raid\u300f, you get to choose the heroes you want. Build your perfect team with characters that match your playstyle. Each hero brings unique skills and roles, making team synergy and positioning key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/a28a3d169caceecbfd6a5f53ac1975d1.poster.avif?t=1752566499\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/a28a3d169caceecbfd6a5f53ac1975d1.webm?t=1752566499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/a28a3d169caceecbfd6a5f53ac1975d1.mp4?t=1752566499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Favorites with Stylish Costumes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your favorite heroes stand out! Unlock and equip a wide variety of costumes to express your style and bring even more personality to your squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/9b0c499cc9463465114e6ca356b387ed.poster.avif?t=1752566499\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/9b0c499cc9463465114e6ca356b387ed.webm?t=1752566499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/9b0c499cc9463465114e6ca356b387ed.mp4?t=1752566499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rediscover the Beloved Story of King's Raid</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump back into the world that fans around the world fell in love with. Explore a deep narrative filled with unforgettable characters and epic quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/0fe4fa4df7353be1511f1bd41d97d361.poster.avif?t=1752566499\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/0fe4fa4df7353be1511f1bd41d97d361.webm?t=1752566499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689540/extras/0fe4fa4df7353be1511f1bd41d97d361.mp4?t=1752566499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Up in Powerful Co-op Raids</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take down massive bosses with your friends in exciting co-op raid battles. Earn powerful gear and keep pushing your limits as the raid bosses grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add the game to your Steam Wishlist and stay up to date by subscribing to our email newsletter or joining us on Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Screenshots shown in the store may differ from actual in-game content.</p>",
